late_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le14ob02re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob02re2aud01 NO STEWARD", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh gosh, not the middle seat! Flying is not my favorite pastime!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Here take mine, sitting in the middle doesn't bother me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Traveling in the future is going to be a lot more luxurious than it is now. Did you know that people will be flying in planes with a panoramic view? Apparently, there will also be memory foam seats that morph into the perfect fit.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds amazing.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: For long flights, they will spray sleep hormones so everyone will be able to arrive well-rested, especially after a long overseas flight.", "id": 1}, {"time": "40000", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This sounds great, but by the time that happens, I will have perished, or I will have stopped traveling because I'll be ancient.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I think we will experience some of it. Also I hope that by the time it happens, the earth won't have been destroyed by climate change or war.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I didn't know you were such a wealth of knowledge V. I just can't wait until we are sitting by the pool sipping fruit cocktails.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I'm so happy we won't be wearing winter coats! Also we won't be cooking or cleaning or working! Being on holidays is so wonderful!", "id": 2}, {"time": "76000", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Steward</span>: Will you be having a beverage?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh yes. I'll have pineapple juice.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: And I'll have water.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Steward</span>: Please don't hesitate to ask. The plane lands in about ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: By the time the flight is over, I'll have fallen for someone!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Or I'll have had a panic attack.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's just a bit of turbulence. You'll be fine.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Talking About the Future"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Dreaming Big"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses vs. Regular Future Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense</span> to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous </span> is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + <span class=\"italic\">be</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect </span>is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will </span>+ <span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for a comparison of the other tenses used to talk about the future."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about things that are not decided, make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future or make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will</span> also be memory foam seats that  morph into the perfect fit. <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'll</span> have pineapple juice.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Traveling in the future <span class=\\\"strong\\\">is going to be</span> a lot more luxurious than it is now.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I just can't wait until <span class=\\\"strong\\\">we are sitting</span> by the pool sipping fruit cocktails. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about schedules\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The plane <span class=\\\"strong\\\">lands</span> in about 10 minutes.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm so happy we <span class=\\\"strong\\\">won't be wearing</span> winter coats!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">By the time that happens, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">I will have perished</span>.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Traveling in the future is going to be a lot more luxurious than it is now."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Will you be having a beverage?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm so happy we won't be wearing winter coats!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have stopped traveling because I'll be ancient."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did you know that people will be flying in planes with a panoramic view? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "By the time the flight is over, I'll have fallen for someone!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Also we won't be cooking or cleaning or working! "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Gerunds"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When a verb ends in <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>, it may be a present participle or it may be a gerund.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span> form more like a verb or an adjective, it is usually a <span class=\"strong\">present participle</span>:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Vanessa is <span class=\"strong\">shopping</span>.<br/>The movie is <span class=\"strong\">exciting</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When we use a verb in <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> form more like a noun, it is usually a <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span>:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Shopping</span> is fun.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You should think of a gerund as a noun in verb form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Like nouns, gerunds can be the subject or object of a sentence:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Sitting</span> in the middle doesn't bother me. <br/>I will have stopped <span class=\"strong\">traveling</span> because I'll be ancient.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Gerunds are sometimes called \"verbal nouns\"."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Flying is not my favorite pastime!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Traveling in the future is going to be a lot more luxurious than it is now."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have stopped traveling because I'll be ancient."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being on holidays is so wonderful!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sitting in the middle doesn't bother me. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le14ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "panoramic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "giving an unobstructed view of an extensive area in all directions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you know that people will be flying in planes with a panoramic view?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear about changes in the future."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "memory foam"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a material that is sensitive to pressure and temperature"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Apparently, there will also be memory foam seats. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "morph into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to gradually change into a different stage"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Foam seats will  morph into the perfect fit. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hesitate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pause or wait in uncertainty"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please don't hesitate to ask."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to spray"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to disperse a liquid in a jet of droplets or particles"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They will spray sleep hormones."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hormones"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a substance produced by one tissue and conveyed by the bloodstream to another to carry out bodily functions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sleep hormones will be spread in passengers to sleep and rest."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "panic attack"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an intense attack of anxiety characterized by feelings of impending doom and despair"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll have had a panic attack."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wealth of knowledge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a great deal of knowledge about a subject or many subjects"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I didn't know you were such a wealth of knowledge."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Share your predictions for the future of your country with a friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your friend about their predictions for the future of your country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out about 3 or 4 other people's predictions for the future of your country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a journal entry including a prediction that each person made. Say if you think it will happen or not and why."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the future of my country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask others to make predictions about our/their country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discover other people's predictions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write and share my journal entry about the predictions, and correct any errors."}]}]}